1
00:00:01,590 --> 00:00:19,979
Tokenized stocks pay dividends in a way wallets can't see. On September 10, NVDAB's multiplier rose to 1.000778. No token was sent. The wallet still shows 10 tokens. The holder owns 10.0078 shares.

2
00:00:21,784 --> 00:00:29,976
That dividend is income, but no Transfer event records it. Tax tools see nothing, and no wallet can answer: did I get the dividend?

3
00:00:33,788 --> 00:00:52,967
Lending protocols count raw tokens. This Lista borrower posted 899.87 NVDAB, worth 900.57 shares. If Lista's oracle prices per share, that's about $295 undercounted today. After a 2-for-1 split, half.

4
00:00:54,771 --> 00:01:14,184
NVIDIA has two tokens on BSC. NVDAB has a $3.8 million pool. NVDAon has under $10,000. A raw price gap can just be a dividend. And for $25, GOOGLB bought 0.9% more Alphabet than GOOGLon.

5
00:01:15,990 --> 00:01:23,841
Same holding, four answers. Binance multiplies, wallets don't, lenders price raw tokens, and tax software sees nothing.

6
00:01:27,994 --> 00:01:38,511
Shaddai is share-true accounting for tokenized stocks on BSC. Store raw, show share-equivalents, and if a factor can't be read, say unread. Never assume one.

7
00:01:40,316 --> 00:01:54,055
From one address: a share-true portfolio, a corporate-action ledger with CSV, collateral warnings with a pre-split preview, a direct dividend answer, a per-share wrapper spread, and a buy sized in dollars of stock.

8
00:01:56,320 --> 00:02:10,677
It reads the BEP-677 multiplier and its schedule, Ondo's sValue oracle, Venus, Lista and PancakeSwap, and the Binance Web3 API. Out come the app, a CSV, and MCP tools.

9
00:02:12,481 --> 00:02:22,060
All measured on BSC mainnet: real multipliers, a real Lista borrower, live Binance quotes, and a thin Ondo twin refused before quoting.

10
00:02:27,486 --> 00:02:37,534
Agents get the same answers as MCP tools. An agent that calls balanceOf reports tokens as shares. One that calls sharetrue dividend gets it right.

11
00:02:41,490 --> 00:02:49,383
Spot only, BSC only. Your wallet signs. Unread factors, halted markets and thin books are refused, not guessed.

12
00:02:54,495 --> 00:02:59,060
Your wallet counts tokens. Shaddai counts shares. Part two: the walkthrough.
